description:
Define format for persisting sessions:

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "session-xxx",
  "created": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
  "project": "/path/to/project",
  "conversation": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "...", "ts": "..."},
    {"role": "assistant", "content": "...", "ts": "..."}
  ],
  "metadata": {...}
}
```

Store in: ~/.emacs.d/efrit/sessions/
